{
  "_readme": "The conversion of a Codex v2 item/autoApprovalReview/completed notification into the core GuardianAssessmentEvent that thread/approveGuardianDeniedAction parses. The worker sends this event when the user approves an action that auto-review denied. The two shapes differ in their casing, in their variant tags, in the network protocol and command source spellings, and in two field types: the write-to-stdin directory is a file URI, and file-system permissions are either legacy read and write roots or canonical entries. Each case gives the notification params and the exact event. The Go conversion in the Codex provider replays every case, and each event was sent to the codex app-server of codexVersion, which accepted it. A new Codex version that changes either shape fails the replay or the probe, not a user's approval.",
  "codexVersion": "0.162.1",
